1f:T931,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why hire an independent developer instead of an agency for custom web development?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Working with me gives you direct access to the senior engineer building your codebase. There are no project managers diluting communication, no hidden overhead fees, and no junior staff assigned to your project. You get faster iteration cycles, consistent engineering standards, and complete accountability from discovery through post-launch support."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a typical startup web app development project take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most focused MVPs and custom web applications launch within 4 to 8 weeks depending on scope, authentication complexity, and third-party integrations. Because I work with modular React and Next.js architectures and pre-tested backend patterns, we move swiftly into user-facing testing without cutting technical corners."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will I own all code, intellectual property, and deployment infrastructure?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, 100%. All repository code, database migrations, configuration scripts, and documentation belong completely to you upon project milestone completion. I build using open-source, vendor-neutral tooling without proprietary lock-ins, so your team or future hires can easily build on the foundation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you ensure responsive website development across all screen sizes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I test layouts continuously across real iOS and Android mobile viewports, tablets, laptops, and ultra-wide desktop monitors. Using CSS grid, flexible flexbox primitives, and fluid typography, your application delivers an intuitive, thumb-friendly mobile experience alongside an expansive desktop dashboard."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you work with my existing design files or wireframes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. If you have Figma, Sketch, or Adobe XD mockups, I translate them with obsessive attention to spacing, hierarchy, and micro-interactions. If you only have wireframes or product specs, I provide website design services and interactive UI layouts tailored to your brand."}}]}1d:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1f"}}]
